    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Estrategia",
      "description": "Cantina Canalla is the fusion between Mexican tradition and a sophisticated, irreverent spirit. Its premium culinary proposal needed a visual and digital identity that reflected its vibrant, bold, and exclusive essence. The challenge was to consolidate its positioning as a reference in Mexican haute cuisine in Spain, creating a branding and content strategy that communicated its transgressive character. Our solution: elevate its image with a powerful visual concept and an aspirational digital narrative that connected with its ideal audience."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Diseño",
      "description": "We transformed their identity into a striking visual experience. Inspired by Mexico's cultural richness and urban art, we developed an aesthetic that combines neon, lucha libre, Frida Kahlo, and Day of the Dead with an intense palette of pink, black, gold, and white. The art direction bet on bold compositions, high-end photography, and textures that reflect their exclusivity. Coherence extended to social media, menus, packaging, and signage, ensuring a powerful and memorable visual experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Resultado",
      "description": "Cantina Canalla's new identity consolidated its positioning as a luxury Mexican gastronomy restaurant. Its image evolved into an aspirational proposal that resonates with a sophisticated audience. The brand experienced +120% growth in engagement, +80% in followers in three months, and a significant increase in reservations and high-ticket customer loyalty."
    },
